#ETH  Weekends are just not the right time for trading. I fiddled around and took a couple of bites, closing my positions until Monday!

This morning I bought in at 2183 and sold at 2164;
In the afternoon, I just closed my position at 2193, and after fees, it was all for nothing;
Tonight, with any major volatility, I'm not even checking the charts;

So on weekends, it's better to chill, catch some Z's, or game rather than stare at the charts. See you all tomorrow morning, bros!
